  "status": "beta",
  "statement": "The real number $x$ satisfies $x + \\dfrac1x = 5$. Find $x^3 + \\dfrac1{x^3}$.",
  "answer_format": "integer_0_999",
  "answer_hash": "0e45a88f",
  "hints": [
    "Expand $\\left(x+\\frac1x\\right)^3$."
  ],
  "solution": "$\\left(x+\\frac1x\\right)^3 = x^3+\\frac1{x^3} + 3\\left(x+\\frac1x\\right)$, so $125 = x^3+\\frac1{x^3} + 15$ and the answer is $110$.",
